  "prefLabel": "Ph 2601.03 Cooperation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 2601.03 Cooperation. In order to clarify, improve, and support appropriate pharmacist prescribing, the board shall periodically review prescribing standards and practices and seek recommendations in consultation with designated representatives from the New Hampshire board of medicine, New Hampshire board of nursing, and the department of health and human services.\n\nSource. #13559, eff 4-12-23",
